<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Dot Net Tech Club</title>
<style>
* { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }

body {
  font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
  min-height: 100vh;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
}

main { flex: 1; }

header {
  display: flex;
  justify-content: space-between;
  align-items: center;
  padding: 16px 24px;
  background: #1F3864;
  color: #fff;
}

header h1 { font-size: 22px; }

nav ul {
  display: flex;
  gap: 20px;
  list-style: none;
}

nav a {
  color: #fff;
  text-decoration: none;
}

.hero {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 12px;
  padding: 40px 16px;
  background: #EEF2FA;
  text-align: center;
}

.hero h2 {
  font-size: 28px;
  color: #1F3864;
}

.hero a {
  padding: 10px 24px;
  background: #1F3864;
  color: #fff;
  text-decoration: none;
  border-radius: 6px;
}

.features {
  display: flex;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  gap: 16px;
  padding: 24px;
}

.card {
  flex: 1 1 200px;
  padding: 20px;
  border: 1px solid #C9D3E6;
  border-radius: 8px;
}

.card h3 {
  margin-bottom: 8px;
  color: #1F3864;
}

footer {
  display: flex;
  justify-content: center;
  padding: 16px;
  background: #1F3864;
  color: #fff;
}

@media (max-width: 600px) {
  header {
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 10px;
  }
}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<header>
<h1>Dot Net Tech Club</h1>
<nav>
<ul>
<li><a href="#">Home</a></li>
<li><a href="#">Programs</a></li>
<li><a href="#">Contact</a></li>
</ul>
</nav>
</header>
<main>
<section class="hero">
<h2>Learn. Build. Share.</h2>
<p>Join our community of student developers.</p>
<a href="#">Join Now</a>
</section>
<section class="features">
<article class="card">
<h3>HTML5</h3>
<p>Structure pages with semantic elements.</p>
</article>
<article class="card">
<h3>CSS Flexbox</h3>
<p>Arrange content in rows and columns.</p>
</article>
<article class="card">
<h3>JavaScript</h3>
<p>Add interaction to every page.</p>
</article>
</section>
</main>
<footer>
<p>&copy; 2026 Dot Net Technologies</p>
</footer>
</body>
</html>
